:: Deadwood Reblooms Beauty Breakthrough []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Niki catches the diffuser before it falls, then crouches beside the dead lamp. Only a hard strip of daylight from the high window
    remains across the white screen.
  <br><br>
  "Could wait for a replacement," Niki says, turning the camera towards the window. "Or use that. No makeup. No filter. Just every mark on your bare
    face."
  <br><br>
  <<link [[Stand in the light|Deadwood Reblooms Beauty Breakthrough Finish]]>><</link>> <<note 'Beauty' 'gold'>>
  <br>
  <<link [[Return to the ordinary shoot|Photo Model 4]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    尼奇赶在柔光板倒下前扶住它，随后蹲到熄灭的灯旁。只有高窗投下的一道生硬日光留在白色幕布前。
  <br><br>
  “可以等人送替换灯过来，”尼奇一边说，一边将相机转向窗户，“也可以就用这束光。不化妆，不加滤镜。你素净脸庞上的每一处痕迹都会被拍下来。”
  <br><br>
  <<link [[站进光里|Deadwood Reblooms Beauty Breakthrough Finish]]>><</link>> <<note '容貌' 'gold'>>
  <br>
  <<link [[回到普通拍摄|Photo Model 4]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
<</language>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Beauty Breakthrough Finish []
<<effects>><<set $photo.time += 30>><<run maplebirch.VP.beauty.complete()>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You step into the strip of daylight. It catches every pore, every blemish and every nervous twitch of your bare face. Niki takes one
    picture, checks it, then raises the camera again without offering powder or softer light.
  <br><br>
  The shutter clicks again and again. When Niki finally lowers the camera, the unedited pictures leave you nowhere to hide. You cannot stop looking
    at them.
  <br><br>
  "Keep them like this," Niki says, saving the set. "They look like you."
  <br><br>
  <span class="gold">Your beauty has broken through its former limits.</span>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你站进那道日光。毫无遮掩的光线照亮你素净脸庞上的每一处毛孔、瑕疵与紧张的抽动。尼奇拍下一张，低头查看，随后再次举起相机，
    没有递来脂粉，也没有调柔光线。
  <br><br>
  快门一次又一次响起。尼奇终于放下相机时，一张张未经修改的照片令你无处遮掩。你却无法把目光移开。
  <br><br>
  “就保持这样。”尼奇保存了整组照片，“这才像你。”
  <br><br>
  <span class="gold">你的容貌突破了原本的极限。</span>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink 'Next' 'Photo Model 5'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Conduct []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'forest_shop'>><<effects>><<run statusCheck('Gwylan')>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You tell Gwylan that you want to lead the next cleansing. You have felt the forest's poison squirm through your body often enough.
    This time, you want it to follow your rhythm.
  <br><br>
  <<He>> stops arranging the bottles behind the counter. <<His>> gaze lingers on you. "You've learned how it moves through you," <<he>> says. "And
    the forest answers when you open yourself to it. That doesn't mean it belongs to you."
  <br><br>
  <<He>> selects several bottles and places them in a case. "You may set the pace and guide the current. I'll prepare the reagents and hold the seal.
    If I tell you to stop, you stop. It doesn't matter how good it feels if the poison escapes back into the world."
  <br><br>
  A familiar heat stirs inside you. Gwylan notices, and smiles. "Very well. Show me what your body has learned."
  <br><br>
  <<link [[Begin the cleansing|Gwylan Ritual Start]]>><<run maplebirch.VP.deviancy.begin()>><</link>>
  <br>
  <<link [[Not today|Forest Shop Entrance]]>><</link>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你告诉格威岚，下一场净化仪式想由自己主持。森林的毒素已经在你的身体里蠕动过太多次。这一次，你想让它顺从你的节奏。
  <br><br>
  <<He>>停下整理柜台后方瓶罐的动作，目光在你身上停留片刻。“你已经学会毒素如何在体内游走，”<<he>>说道，“当你主动向森林敞开身体，它也会回应你。
    但这不代表它属于你。”
  <br><br>
  <<He>>挑出几只瓶子，放进箱中。“你可以控制节奏，引导毒素的流向。药剂和封印仍由我负责。我让你停下时，你就必须停下。无论过程多么舒服，
    毒素若重新逃回这个世界，净化就不算成功。”
  <br><br>
  熟悉的热意在你体内浮现。格威岚注意到了，露出微笑。“很好。让我看看你的身体都学会了什么。”
  <br><br>
  <<link [[开始净化仪式|Gwylan Ritual Start]]>><<run maplebirch.VP.deviancy.begin()>><</link>>
  <br>
  <<link [[今天还是算了|Forest Shop Entrance]]>><</link>>
<</language>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Willpower Unlock 1 []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake_ruin">><<set $bus to "lake_ruin_prison">><<underwater>><<effects>><<set $oxygen -= 80>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You take a deep breath and dive. It is a long way down.<<loxygen>>
  <br><br>
  <<water>><<effectswater "water">>
  <<waterbr 2>>

  When you finally reach the end again, you see the same glowing rune, cold as a gravestone. You stare at its light.
  <br><br>
  <span class="green">You could try holding the rune again.</span>
  <br><br>
  <<link [[Swim back|Lake Ruin Prison]]>><<wraith_pass 2>><</link>>
  <br>
  <<link [[Hold the rune again|Deadwood Reblooms Willpower Unlock 2]]>><<set $oxygen -= 60>><</link>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你深呼吸，潜下水去。这是一段漫长的距离。<<loxygen>>
  <br><br>
  <<water>><<effectswater "water">>
  <<waterbr 2>>

  当你再次到达尽头时，你看到了同样的发光符文，它冰冷得像一块墓碑。你望向那发光符文。
  <br><br>
  <span class="green">你可以再次尝试按住符文。</span>
  <br><br>
  <<link [[游回去|Lake Ruin Prison]]>><<wraith_pass 2>><</link>>
  <br>
  <<link [[再次按住符文|Deadwood Reblooms Willpower Unlock 2]]>><<set $oxygen -= 60>><</link>>
<</language>>
<br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Willpower Unlock 2 []
<<underwater>><<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You press your palm against the rune. Its chill sinks through your skin, followed by a faint pulse from deep within the stone.
  <br><br>
  The ear slimes writhe inside you. Warmth runs down your spine as <span class="lewd">they order you to take your hand away, spread yourself and give
    your body to the pale figure.</span> Your fingers twitch, trying to obey.
  <br><br>
  <<link [[Obey and swim back|Lake Ruin Prison]]>><<wraith_pass 2>><<sub 1>><</link>><<lwillpower>>
  <br>
  <<link [[Defy them and keep hold|Deadwood Reblooms Willpower Unlock 3]]>><<set $oxygen -= 60>><<def 1>><</link>><<gwillpower>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你把手掌按在符文上。寒意透过皮肤渗入，紧接着，石头深处传来微弱的搏动。
  <br><br>
  两团史莱姆同时在你的耳中蠕动。热意沿脊背向下蔓延，<span class="lewd">它们命令你把手拿开，敞开身体，将自己献给苍白的身影。</span>你的手指自行抽动，
    试图服从。
  <br><br>
  <<link [[服从并游回去|Lake Ruin Prison]]>><<wraith_pass 2>><<sub 1>><</link>><<lwillpower>>
  <br>
  <<link [[违抗命令，继续按住|Deadwood Reblooms Willpower Unlock 3]]>><<set $oxygen -= 60>><<def 1>><</link>><<gwillpower>>
<</language>>
<br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Willpower Unlock 3 []
<<underwater>><<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You force your fingers flat against the stone. The slimes fill your thoughts with pale hands spreading and using your helpless body,
    but the pulse beneath your palm grows stronger.
  <br><br>
  The water behind you turns deathly cold. Pale fingers close around your wrist. The pale figure draws close, its voice sounding from inside your
    skull. "<span class="wraith">You will bend. Or you will break.</span>"
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你强迫手指平贴在石头上。史莱姆在你的脑中塞满苍白双手摆弄、享用你无力身体的画面，掌下的搏动却愈发强烈。
  <br><br>
  身后的湖水变得刺骨。苍白的手指扣住你的手腕，苍白的身影贴近过来，声音直接在你的颅内响起。“<span class="wraith">向我屈服。除非你想就此崩溃。</span>”
<</language>>
<<generateWraith 1>><<initWraith "abomination">><<startWraith>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<link [[Resist|Deadwood Reblooms Willpower Unlock Fight]]>><</link>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<link [[反抗|Deadwood Reblooms Willpower Unlock Fight]]>><</link>>
<</language>>
<br>

